1
00:01:33,310 --> 00:01:34,979
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,410 --> 00:01:37,890
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:48,789 --> 00:01:50,229
Where am I?

4
00:01:52,789 --> 00:01:54,310
Didn't I get shot?

5
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,590
Qingyu?

6
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:03,120
Susu...

7
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,230
Where's Susu?

8
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:09,710
Is this my dream?

9
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:32,790
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

10
00:02:32,870 --> 00:02:35,040
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

11
00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:39,360
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

12
00:02:39,390 --> 00:02:41,750
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

13
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,240
Susu!

14
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:47,579
♪ Let the tears fall,
let the blood spill ♪

15
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:50,290
♪ Even through suffering,
I'll never let go of your hand ♪

16
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:54,020
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

17
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:56,470
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

18
00:02:56,490 --> 00:02:57,770
♪ We ♪

19
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,130
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

20
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:06,460
♪ Forevermore ♪

21
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,000
Susu!

22
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,750
Susu.

23
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,090
Who are you calling?

24
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:29,630
No one.

25
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:34,630
Fang Mulan

26
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:36,520
is Ren Susu.

27
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,210
I already know that.

28
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,860
You knew who she really was all along.

29
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:43,290
Why didn't you tell me?

30
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:47,010
She got you thrown into prison,

31
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,890
where your hand was ruined,

32
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,280
and you nearly lost your life.

33
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,630
Yet you actually threatened to
take your own life

34
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:57,760
just to force my hand, all for her sake.

35
00:03:58,310 --> 00:03:59,970
Murong Qingyi, are you crazy?

36
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:09,670
She has a blood feud with the Huo family.

37
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:13,060
Now both the Huos and the police
are hunting her.

38
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:14,470
This is one matter

39
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:16,120
our Murong family

40
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,760
will not get involved in.

41
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,240
The Murong family

42
00:04:24,310 --> 00:04:25,310
has nothing to do with me.

43
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:27,710
Do you even know
how much blood you've lost?

44
00:04:28,390 --> 00:04:31,450
How many lives do you think
you can afford to throw away?

45
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,600
I'm a doctor.

46
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,320
I know exactly how bad

47
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,720
my injuries are.

48
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,630
Look at yourself.

49
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,160
I've already locked up Laiyi

50
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,860
and disbanded the people you rallied

51
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:26,400
after you got out of prison.

52
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,620
Now you're on your own.

53
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,860
What do you have left to help her with?

54
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:34,159
You want to die with her?

55
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,950
Gladly.

56
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:46,170
Call the nurse.

57
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:46,890
Yes, sir.

58
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,890
Focus on recovering first.

59
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,480
After that, I'll send you overseas.

60
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:06,080
Heal your injuries,

61
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:08,110
then continue your studies.

62
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,860
From this day forward,

63
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,360
forget about Ren Susu.

64
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,460
And don't even think about

65
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,060
having anything to do with her again.

66
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:19,450
Do you understand?

67
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:03,160
[Special Care Unit]

68
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,360
After the nurse changes his dressing,

69
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,190
lock the door.

70
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,680
No one may enter

71
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:16,400
except doctors and nurses.

72
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,160
Keep a close watch on him.

73
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,890
Understood.

74
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:21,040
The police

75
00:07:21,090 --> 00:07:26,750
[Special Care Unit]

76
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:24,290
have already issued an arrest warrant
for Miss Fang.

77
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,740
The Huo family is also searching
the whole city for her.

78
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,950
And the matter I asked you to investigate?

79
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,630
After the explosion
at the aviation school's opening ceremony,

80
00:07:32,630 --> 00:07:34,360
I cross-checked the personnel list

81
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,830
and did find a suspicious individual.

82
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:40,310
[Special Care Unit]

83
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:44,920
A foreigner?

84
00:07:45,390 --> 00:07:46,190
That's right.

85
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,480
Her name is Tasia,

86
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,560
a doctor in the concession.

87
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,510
We've found

88
00:07:50,370 --> 00:07:53,510
[Runs a clinic here called Tasia Clinic.]

89
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:52,960
that she and several other young women

90
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:55,159
often gather at this bookstore,

91
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,360
teahouse,

92
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,510
and church.

93
00:07:58,950 --> 00:08:00,800
Miss Fang's movements during this period

94
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,530
overlap with these locations.

95
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,040
Looks like I've found

96
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,240
her weakness.

97
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:16,750
Round them

98
00:08:17,870 --> 00:08:19,390
all up within one day.

99
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,070
I said, within one day.

100
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:27,800
[Special Care Unit]

101
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:25,890
Understood.

102
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,940
As for Qingyi's weakness,

103
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,150
let me

104
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:36,000
get rid of it for him.

105
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:41,309
This is the woman. Take her away.

106
00:08:41,309 --> 00:08:42,020
[Taisheng Bookstore]

107
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:43,960
Search carefully!

108
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:45,440
The principal gave the order—

109
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,100
don't let a single one escape!

110
00:09:03,900 --> 00:09:07,550
[Escaped]

111
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,510
Susu.

112
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:25,170
Take some more fever medicine.

113
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:26,240
Here.

114
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,360
How are things outside?

115
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,900
What about Qingyi?

116
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,840
With his brother around,

117
00:09:46,910 --> 00:09:48,310
he'll naturally be fine.

118
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,870
But...

119
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:52,070
What's wrong?

120
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,480
Jinwei, Yinwei, and Tasia

121
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:57,400
have all been taken
by Murong Qingyu's men.

122
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:03,290
How could this happen?

123
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,000
So Murong Qingyu has been

124
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:13,420
investigating
the aviation school bombing all along.

125
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,810
What's he trying to do?

126
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:22,030
He's trying to force me to turn myself in.

127
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:22,670
No.

128
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,480
Huo Zongqi's death

129
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:26,240
was clearly a frame-up.

130
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:28,030
If you show yourself now,

131
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:29,670
you won't have any chance
to defend yourself.

132
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:31,730
The Huos will simply have you killed.

133
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,320
How are things

134
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,390
with the Huo family's arms supply?

135
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,720
There have indeed been some problems

136
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,850
with the Huo family's arms shipments.

137
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,390
But it'll take time

138
00:10:41,750 --> 00:10:43,600
before it affects the war
and causes the Huos

139
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,860
to fall out of favor with the higher-ups.

140
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,080
And...

141
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,560
And the people in Nanyang...

142
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:52,510
Still no news?

143
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,670
I've sent many telegrams,

144
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:58,120
but the Fang family hasn't replied.

145
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,910
Knowing Murong Qingyu,

146
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:11,100
he won't humiliate or hurt
Tasia and the others.

147
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,910
What should we do now?

148
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,630
Since he wants me to turn myself in...

149
00:11:15,630 --> 00:11:16,270
No!

150
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,000
If you turn yourself in,

151
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,150
the Huos can kill you right there
at the police station.

152
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:23,670
-Murong Qingyi's hand is proof enough.
-But if they're all gone—

153
00:11:23,670 --> 00:11:25,400
if they all end up like Xiaolan—

154
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:29,990
what have all these years of
painstaking effort been for?

155
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,120
And what's the point...

156
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,910
of me staying alive?

157
00:11:58,670 --> 00:11:59,670
All this time,

158
00:11:59,870 --> 00:12:01,670
you've been the one making plans,

159
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:03,000
making the tough calls,

160
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:05,270
and taking on
the most dangerous work yourself

161
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,240
to protect us.

162
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:08,960
You've forgotten—and so have I—

163
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,420
that you're actually
the youngest among us.

164
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:17,240
I promised Xiaolan

165
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,140
that I'd take good care of you.

166
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,480
I also promised Uncle Fang

167
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:26,320
I'd get justice for Xiaolan.

168
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:30,510
And I promised all of you

169
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:34,000
I'd make the Huos
pay for what they'd done.

170
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,170
I'll make good on every promise I've made.

171
00:12:46,510 --> 00:12:47,640
It's still raining.

172
00:12:49,670 --> 00:12:51,330
Remember to take an umbrella.

173
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,180
It's time to change the dressing.

174
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:38,640
Young Master Qingyi,

175
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,360
you're going to owe me

176
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,120
a big favor for this.

177
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,600
"The isolated house

178
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,660
up behind Xiangshui Ravine."

179
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:34,390
Murong Qingyi, slow down!

180
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:29,440
You're here.

181
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,660
Why did you ask me to come here?

182
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,320
I'm here to give you a choice.

183
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,720
You have a plan?

184
00:15:52,870 --> 00:15:53,910
Turn me in.

185
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,580
Tell them that I killed

186
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:58,670
Huo Zongqi.

187
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,780
You've really lost your mind.

188
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,700
I've heard you say that

189
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,150
so many times.

190
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,270
I'm sick of it.

191
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:11,600
What does this have to do with you?

192
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,730
This has nothing to do with you either.

193
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:26,440
Huo Zongqi deserved to die.

194
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,720
No matter who killed him,

195
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,230
what they really want

196
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,930
is for you to die with him

197
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,550
and the Huo family.

198
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:36,670
Then why would you take the blame for me?

199
00:16:36,670 --> 00:16:38,120
Would the Huo family even believe it?

200
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:39,030
Would they just let it go?

201
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:40,790
I don't need them to let it go.

202
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,680
All I want to fight for

203
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,000
is your innocence.

204
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:01,830
As long as our statements match—

205
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,720
that I killed Huo Zongqi—

206
00:17:04,550 --> 00:17:06,880
Li Boze will lift the warrant against you.

207
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,270
My brother

208
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,480
will also release those girls.

209
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,810
And all you have to do

210
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,440
is wait it out openly,

211
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,030
with nothing to hide.

212
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:20,690
What about you?

213
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,440
I have my brother.

214
00:17:27,550 --> 00:17:28,640
He'll keep me safe.

215
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,700
What are your chances?

216
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,680
About 50%.

217
00:17:37,550 --> 00:17:39,000
If he can't,

218
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,840
it will be just like 3 years ago.

219
00:17:42,550 --> 00:17:44,010
You will be sent to prison,

220
00:17:44,350 --> 00:17:46,550
and everything the Huo family did to you

221
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:47,880
will happen again.

222
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:57,750
So what?

223
00:17:58,790 --> 00:18:01,050
At worst, they'll ruin my right hand too.

224
00:18:09,550 --> 00:18:10,920
Aren't you the Ren Susu who dares to act

225
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,450
even with only a 10% chance?

226
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:13,680
What?

227
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,380
Now that it's a 50% chance,

228
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:16,450
you're scared?

229
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,480
Besides,

230
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:22,110
it's my life at stake,

231
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:23,270
not yours

232
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,750
or your sisters'.

233
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,240
What?

234
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:35,970
Afraid you'll never see me again?

235
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,820
You're wagering your life for us.

236
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:46,830
How generous.

237
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:51,010
Still no match for you—

238
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,940
always willing to gamble with your life.

239
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:57,880
What's your condition?

240
00:19:04,550 --> 00:19:05,640
Stay here with me

241
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:06,790
for one day.

242
00:19:12,110 --> 00:19:12,880
One day?

243
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:15,510
Is one day too much to ask?

244
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:17,270
Ren Susu,

245
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:20,560
you can't even spare me one day?

246
00:19:29,350 --> 00:19:30,160
I agree.

247
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,540
I've moved everything from the cabin

248
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,160
in Beicheng to here.

249
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:03,030
This painting

250
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:05,410
is the one you never got to finish.

251
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:06,920
I thought

252
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,050
if you ever came back...

253
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:12,840
you might want to finish it.

254
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:22,960
How is it? Is it done?

255
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:24,960
It's not finished yet.

256
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,490
Let me take a look first.

257
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:32,960
No.

258
00:20:33,510 --> 00:20:35,110
I'll show you when it's done.

259
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,200
What are you doing?

260
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:46,880
Which one is me?

261
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,720
I'm not done yet.

262
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:49,050
Let me take a look first.

263
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:52,310
No.

264
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,240
No, no.

265
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,240
Give it to me.

266
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:55,160
That's me.

267
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:58,200
Give it back to me.

268
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,240
No.

269
00:21:01,070 --> 00:21:01,880
Give it to me.

270
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:02,750
Let me see.

271
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,440
Give it to me.

272
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,240
Let me see what you're painting.

273
00:21:07,110 --> 00:21:08,070
Come back.

274
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:09,880
No, no.

275
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,720
If you couldn't see it,

276
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,600
you'd probably be upset.

277
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:25,160
But back then,

278
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,690
you clearly thought I was dead.

279
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:32,310
Yeah.

280
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:35,240
But...

281
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,070
what if?

282
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:47,750
How about...

283
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:50,110
you finish it now?

284
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,570
I'll go make dinner.

285
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:04,170
Since when do you know how to cook?

286
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:05,790
Just wait and see.

287
00:22:53,900 --> 00:22:55,690
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

288
00:22:55,710 --> 00:22:57,550
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

289
00:22:58,950 --> 00:23:00,690
♪ In the misty train car ♪

290
00:23:00,780 --> 00:23:04,310
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

291
00:23:05,260 --> 00:23:09,270
♪ If you have any ♪

292
00:23:09,330 --> 00:23:11,450
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

293
00:23:13,030 --> 00:23:13,680
How is it?

294
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:15,310
It's so good.

295
00:23:14,730 --> 00:23:17,290
♪ Memories are like falling into a trap ♪

296
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:16,800
You try it too.

297
00:23:17,330 --> 00:23:19,440
♪ Full of mud ♪

298
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,310
It's that good?

299
00:23:19,460 --> 00:23:21,580
♪ The more I struggle,
the more suffocated I become ♪

300
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:24,810
♪ But I couldn't resist collecting them ♪

301
00:23:24,970 --> 00:23:27,380
♪ I keep collecting ♪

302
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:27,120
What are you laughing at?

303
00:23:27,350 --> 00:23:28,720
Nothing. Drink it up.

304
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:30,080
♪ Every word and comment ♪

305
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:32,380
♪ They speak of you ♪

306
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:34,920
♪ You are so clear ♪

307
00:23:32,470 --> 00:23:33,790
Hey, you ambushed me.

308
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,200
Don't run!

309
00:23:34,950 --> 00:23:36,610
♪ So close and so clear ♪

310
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:40,020
♪ If you possibly ♪

311
00:23:40,050 --> 00:23:42,160
♪ Still have the courage ♪

312
00:23:42,180 --> 00:23:47,490
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

313
00:23:48,770 --> 00:23:50,980
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

314
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:54,620
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

315
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:20,930
Dinner's ready.

316
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,830
It looks pretty decent.

317
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:37,590
Of course.

318
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,000
Braised pork?

319
00:24:42,270 --> 00:24:42,830
Try it.

320
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:45,640
You taught me how to make it.
Did you forget?

321
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,640
Cut the pork belly into cubes.

322
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,030
Heat oil in the pan,

323
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:53,960
add the pork belly,
and stir-fry it until browned.

324
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:56,020
Then simmer it on low heat for an hour.

325
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,240
My mom's secret recipe

326
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,590
is to add 10 dried plums.

327
00:24:59,720 --> 00:25:01,640
The sweet-and-sour flavor
can cut through the richness.

328
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,440
Give it a try.

329
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:22,330
You added the plums?

330
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,330
The plums' flavor isn't quite authentic.

331
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:31,040
Just tell me if it's good or not.

332
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:34,720
It's okay.

333
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:40,010
There's room for improvement next time.

334
00:25:44,550 --> 00:25:45,680
There's a next time?

335
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,400
I finished the painting.

336
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,240
Wanna see it?

337
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:01,590
Sure.

338
00:26:18,790 --> 00:26:20,680
Can you give me just one second?

339
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:25,530
Just love me for one second.

340
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,750
This is for me?

341
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,800
You're not sitting down?

342
00:27:22,030 --> 00:27:23,090
I'm fine standing.

343
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:32,720
I'm just a bit cold.

344
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,930
Why don't you get another blanket?

345
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,270
Whenever I came here before,

346
00:27:38,270 --> 00:27:39,480
I always used this one.

347
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:40,280
I'm used to it.

348
00:27:41,750 --> 00:27:42,510
Then I'll go get one.

349
00:27:42,510 --> 00:27:43,170
Don't move.

350
00:27:44,790 --> 00:27:46,850
I'm doing something important here.

351
00:27:50,030 --> 00:27:51,290
What important thing?

352
00:27:53,510 --> 00:27:54,310
Stargazing.

353
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:59,080
Then what did you see?

354
00:28:00,750 --> 00:28:01,680
Look at that one.

355
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,480
Is that the North Star?

356
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,920
That's Dubhe.

357
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:08,880
The one above it

358
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:09,880
is the North Star.

359
00:28:52,830 --> 00:28:54,920
It really is pretty chilly out.

360
00:29:13,030 --> 00:29:13,960
You used to...

361
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:17,010
love smiling like that.

362
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,590
Have I changed a lot

363
00:29:31,830 --> 00:29:33,160
compared to 3 years ago?

364
00:29:37,270 --> 00:29:38,550
People change.

365
00:29:48,350 --> 00:29:49,550
I only changed

366
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:50,550
because you left.

367
00:29:52,750 --> 00:29:54,510
That time we had 3 years ago

368
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,930
was quite short, wasn't it?

369
00:29:58,270 --> 00:29:59,480
You mean,

370
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:02,460
I should've forgotten you since we'd

371
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:04,750
been together for only 3 months,

372
00:30:04,750 --> 00:30:05,440
right?

373
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:11,400
Ren Susu,

374
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:13,960
who taught you

375
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,640
to measure the depth of love

376
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:18,100
by the amount of time
people spend together?

377
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,440
Why haven't you

378
00:30:24,270 --> 00:30:25,670
moved on all these years?

379
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,820
Isn't that just human nature?

380
00:30:36,790 --> 00:30:37,830
The less you have,

381
00:30:38,510 --> 00:30:40,510
the more afraid you are of losing it.

382
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,920
The moment I lost you

383
00:30:44,790 --> 00:30:46,350
3 years ago,

384
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:49,960
I had nothing left.

385
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:00,270
Being alive means

386
00:31:02,270 --> 00:31:04,270
having to lose things along the way.

387
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:10,920
But I've stayed alive

388
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,680
in order to find you.

389
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:28,880
Qingyi.

390
00:31:32,470 --> 00:31:33,800
You should've hated me.

391
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:44,680
Yes.

392
00:31:48,830 --> 00:31:50,490
I really should've hated you.

393
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:52,030
You were the one who taught me

394
00:31:52,030 --> 00:31:53,830
that when the best things in life

395
00:31:54,030 --> 00:31:56,160
fall into your hands without warning,

396
00:31:57,070 --> 00:31:58,800
they're usually not a blessing

397
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:00,720
but a curse.

398
00:32:04,750 --> 00:32:06,200
But if one day

399
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:10,340
I truly come to hate you...

400
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:15,130
it'll be a long, long time from now.

401
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:17,240
Because the day

402
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,130
I stop loving you...

403
00:32:22,270 --> 00:32:24,270
the only thing that'll keep me alive

404
00:32:26,070 --> 00:32:27,270
is hatred.

405
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:38,680
So

406
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:40,270
I really wish

407
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,790
time could stop at this second.

408
00:33:06,590 --> 00:33:07,310
Qingyi.

409
00:33:45,610 --> 00:33:49,590
♪ In those fleeting
three seconds of twilight ♪

410
00:33:51,630 --> 00:33:55,390
♪ An amber dream shimmers
within the glass ♪

411
00:33:57,710 --> 00:34:01,810
♪ The ice of loneliness
melts away in the warmth ♪

412
00:34:04,060 --> 00:34:07,820
♪ Your evasive gaze
gives your heart away ♪

413
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:13,920
♪ Don't tell me ♪

414
00:34:14,610 --> 00:34:18,810
♪ You're tired again, this time, don't ♪

415
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:23,290
♪ Don't push me away
only to draw me close ♪

416
00:34:23,350 --> 00:34:24,909
♪ Why so nervous? ♪

417
00:34:25,420 --> 00:34:28,540
♪ Please don't stay frozen for too long ♪

418
00:34:29,460 --> 00:34:31,280
♪ Say my name ♪

419
00:34:32,600 --> 00:34:34,630
♪ Please don't stop ♪

420
00:34:34,670 --> 00:34:39,420
♪ Forgive me, I've loved you for ages ♪

421
00:34:40,679 --> 00:34:43,270
♪ Please lull me into absolute surrender ♪

422
00:34:43,330 --> 00:34:46,449
♪ Before you cage me
in a prison of your design ♪

423
00:34:47,120 --> 00:34:51,409
♪ Stop bowing to the crowd ♪

424
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:56,770
♪ No matter how many words I got wrong,
in the end ♪

425
00:34:57,590 --> 00:35:00,720
♪ I never had what I longed for ♪

426
00:35:00,740 --> 00:35:04,260
♪ Only a receding tide ♪

427
00:35:05,250 --> 00:35:09,710
♪ Just you and me, all else fades away ♪

428
00:35:44,230 --> 00:35:45,030
You're awake.

429
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,860
I'm almost finished cleaning up.

430
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:53,610
And I've prepared breakfast for you.

431
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:55,480
If it gets cold,

432
00:35:55,960 --> 00:35:57,620
just heat it up before you eat.

433
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,800
You're leaving?

434
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,320
Didn't we agree?

435
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:06,710
Just one day.

436
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:20,410
But we still have one dance
we never finished.

437
00:36:40,670 --> 00:36:42,800
Remember what I taught you 3 years ago?

438
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:46,280
Back then, the tango was
all the rage in Beicheng.

439
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:48,150
The foxtrot is tender and romantic,

440
00:36:48,150 --> 00:36:50,610
while the tango is
a head-on confrontation.

441
00:36:52,550 --> 00:36:53,800
The tango is a battle,

442
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,420
a contest of wills.

443
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:59,230
It looks like each step is
pressing the other back,

444
00:36:59,230 --> 00:37:01,400
but in truth, the two dancers are
hopelessly entangled.

445
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:03,260
It restrains passion with rules,

446
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:06,360
only to break those rules through passion.

447
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:08,940
The man and the woman dance

448
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:11,550
as though they're determined to
fight to the death

449
00:37:11,550 --> 00:37:13,080
on the battlefield of love.

450
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:15,800
You've always had

451
00:37:16,280 --> 00:37:17,510
such unusual tastes.

452
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:19,880
I'm unusual?

453
00:37:20,590 --> 00:37:21,280
You are.

454
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,190
Just like that movie,

455
00:37:24,710 --> 00:37:25,970
"Autumn in the South."

456
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:30,360
You found it boring and left early.

457
00:37:31,710 --> 00:37:32,840
But I thought

458
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:34,670
it was gripping

459
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,360
and pretty good.

460
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:41,550
So you're questioning my taste now?

461
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:45,370
You were clearly having plenty of fun
learning that dance.

462
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:53,800
By the way, those roasted sweet potatoes
you gave me as thanks

463
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:55,360
were completely tasteless.

464
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:57,480
Your driving skills are really terrible.

465
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:59,280
Your painting skills are just average.

466
00:37:59,280 --> 00:38:01,190
You look so childish when you argue.

467
00:38:01,190 --> 00:38:02,960
You were the one who started it.

468
00:38:02,960 --> 00:38:04,670
You're so mean with your words
that no one can stand you.

469
00:38:04,670 --> 00:38:06,030
But you seemed to enjoy kissing me.

470
00:38:06,030 --> 00:38:07,290
I was only pretending.

471
00:38:16,840 --> 00:38:17,840
Ren Susu,

472
00:38:19,030 --> 00:38:21,690
even now, you still want to
beat me one more time?

473
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:46,720
♪ The more passionate ♪

474
00:38:46,820 --> 00:38:48,760
♪ Our past embrace ♪

475
00:38:51,660 --> 00:38:53,210
♪ The more icy ♪

476
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:52,760
Murong Qingyi,

477
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:55,510
♪ Our present clash ♪

478
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,360
I've given you the dance

479
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:55,800
I owed you.

480
00:38:57,380 --> 00:38:59,670
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

481
00:39:00,290 --> 00:39:03,410
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

482
00:39:03,940 --> 00:39:08,480
♪ There is no escaping it ♪
